# Agent Handoff Directory

This directory stores handoff reports between agents during automation building.

## Structure

```
.claude/handoffs/{session-id}/
├── phase1-plan-report.md
├── phase2-implementation-report.md
├── phase3-test-report.md
├── phase4-docs-report.md
├── phase5-deploy-report.md
├── phase6-verify-report.md
└── session-summary.md
```

## Session IDs

Format: `{client}-{automation-id}-{timestamp}`

Example: `herbox-a6.1-20260115-143022`

## Purpose

- **Agent Handoffs**: Pass context between phases
- **Audit Trail**: Track what happened in each phase
- **Resumability**: Allow sessions to be paused and resumed
- **Debugging**: Review what went wrong if issues occur
